                                "sense_id": "2f879af6-fc38-3515-b95f-db3b8d30f07d",
                                "text": "But he would not publicly confirm his purchase of “Hercules and Achelous,” or another rarity that experts say he bought this year: a limewood figure of St. Catherine by the German Medieval sculptor Tilman Riemenschneider that went for $6.3 million at Sotheby’s in January."
